## Debugging

See [environment and configuration](environment-config.mdc#module-specific-logging)
for storage and runtime logging filters.

| Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `Lemonade Server not available` | The selected runtime or server is unavailable | See [connection selection](environment-config.mdc#lemonade-connection-selection) |
| Transcription returns immediate error | Model not pulled or server can't open audio | Use `lemonade pull <transcription-model>`; verify audio bytes are non-empty |
| Transcription test passes but text is noise | Silence input hallucinations are normal | Use real speech for content assertions; only check `result.is_ok()` for silence |
| FTS5 search returns nothing | Chunk not yet added for the object | Call `add_text_chunk` before `search_chunks_fts` |
| `database is locked` | Two processes sharing the same `knowledge.db` | Ensure only one writer at a time |
| Import creates 0 edges | References are unresolved, ambiguous, or schema-invalid | Inspect the `.u-forge-import-diagnostics` sidecar; use a UUID or `object_type:name` to disambiguate |
| Schema validation fails on known type | Schema not loaded before validation | Call `SchemaIngestion::load_schemas_from_directory` and `save_schema` first |
